contract CollaborationEnvelope.
field CorrelationIdentity.
feature DesignNavigation.
interface DevelopmentHostPort.
capability DocumentDelivery.
interface DocumentDeliveryPort.
interface DocumentSnapshotPort.
capability DocumentSnapshots.
unit ExternalCodexAppServer.
channel GovernanceCalls.
contract GovernanceCallsProtocol.
activity IntegratedGovernancePilot.
unit KanBanCli.
unit KanBanTui.
channel McpCalls.
contract McpCallsProtocol.
mode ModelBrowsing.
capability ModelProjection.
