AgentGovernance supports ChooseRoutine.
BoardCalls upholds BoardCallsProtocol.
BoardCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
BoardCallsProtocol permits BoardSnapshot.
BoardCallsProtocol permits ReadBoard.
BoardInspection supports BrowseBoard.
BoardSnapshot has message-kind = result.
BoardSnapshot replies-to ReadBoard.
BoardSnapshot upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
BrowseArchitecturePath exercises BrowseArchitecture.
BrowseArchitecturePath has completeness = closed.
BrowseArchitecturePath runs-in ModelBrowsing.
BrowseArchitecturePath step 1 sends SelectModelView from CodexClient to SdpTool via NavigationCalls.
BrowseArchitecturePath step 2 sends ProjectValidatedModel from SdpTool to SdlViewpoints via ProjectionCalls.
BrowseArchitecturePath step 3 sends ProjectedDocument from SdlViewpoints to SdpTool via ProjectionCalls reply-to 2.
BrowseArchitecturePath step 4 sends SelectedDocument from SdpTool to CodexClient via NavigationCalls reply-to 1.
BrowseBoardPath exercises BrowseBoard.
BrowseBoardPath has completeness = closed.
BrowseBoardPath runs-in ModelBrowsing.
BrowseBoardPath step 1 sends ReadBoard from KanBanTui to SdpTool via BoardCalls.
BrowseBoardPath step 2 sends BoardSnapshot from SdpTool to KanBanTui via BoardCalls reply-to 1.
ChooseRoutinePath exercises ChooseRoutine.
ChooseRoutinePath has completeness = closed.
ChooseRoutinePath runs-in RoutineSelection.
ChooseRoutinePath step 1 sends RequestRoutine from ExternalCodexAppServer to SdpMcpAdapter via McpCalls.
ChooseRoutinePath step 2 sends RouteIntent from SdpMcpAdapter to SdpTool via GovernanceCalls.
ChooseRoutinePath step 3 sends RouteDecision from SdpTool to SdpMcpAdapter via GovernanceCalls reply-to 2.
ChooseRoutinePath step 4 sends RoutineResponse from SdpMcpAdapter to ExternalCodexAppServer via McpCalls reply-to 1.
CodexClient consumes DevelopmentHostPort.
CodexClient uses NavigationCalls as receiver of SelectedDocument in mode ModelBrowsing.
CodexClient uses NavigationCalls as sender of SelectModelView in mode ModelBrowsing.
CollaborationEnvelope has completeness = closed.
CollaborationEnvelope has-field CorrelationIdentity.
CorrelationIdentity has presence = required.
CorrelationIdentity has value-type = text.
DesignNavigation supports BrowseArchitecture.
ExternalCodexAppServer uses McpCalls as receiver of RoutineResponse in mode RoutineSelection.
ExternalCodexAppServer uses McpCalls as sender of RequestRoutine in mode RoutineSelection.
GovernanceCalls upholds GovernanceCallsProtocol.
GovernanceCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
GovernanceCallsProtocol permits RouteDecision.
GovernanceCallsProtocol permits RouteIntent.
IntegratedGovernancePilot has implementation-status = planned.
KanBanTui uses BoardCalls as receiver of BoardSnapshot in mode ModelBrowsing.
KanBanTui uses BoardCalls as sender of ReadBoard in mode ModelBrowsing.
McpCalls upholds McpCallsProtocol.
McpCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
McpCallsProtocol permits RequestRoutine.
McpCallsProtocol permits RoutineResponse.
NavigationCalls upholds NavigationCallsProtocol.
NavigationCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
NavigationCallsProtocol permits SelectModelView.
NavigationCallsProtocol permits SelectedDocument.
ProjectOwner pursues BrowseArchitecture.
ProjectOwner pursues BrowseBoard.
ProjectOwner pursues ChooseRoutine.
ProjectValidatedModel has message-kind = request.
ProjectValidatedModel upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
ProjectedDocument has message-kind = result.
ProjectedDocument replies-to ProjectValidatedModel.
ProjectedDocument upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
ProjectionCalls upholds ProjectionCallsProtocol.
ProjectionCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
ProjectionCallsProtocol permits ProjectValidatedModel.
ProjectionCallsProtocol permits ProjectedDocument.
ReadBoard has message-kind = request.
ReadBoard upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
RequestRoutine has message-kind = request.
RequestRoutine upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
RouteDecision has message-kind = result.
RouteDecision replies-to RouteIntent.
RouteDecision upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
RouteIntent has message-kind = request.
RouteIntent upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
RoutineResponse has message-kind = result.
RoutineResponse replies-to RequestRoutine.
RoutineResponse upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
SdlActionRuntime provides ActionExecution.
SdlCodeGeneration consumes UiCodeGenerationPort.
SdlDevelopmentHost provides ChangeRebuild.
SdlDocumentService provides DocumentDelivery.
SdlDocumentSnapshot provides DocumentSnapshots.
SdlFrontend provides ModelValidation.
SdlViewpoints consumes ModelValidationPort.
SdlViewpoints provides ModelProjection.
SdlViewpoints uses ProjectionCalls as receiver of ProjectValidatedModel in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdlViewpoints uses ProjectionCalls as sender of ProjectedDocument in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdpMcpAdapter consumes ProjectServicesPort.
SdpMcpAdapter uses GovernanceCalls as receiver of RouteDecision in mode RoutineSelection.
SdpMcpAdapter uses GovernanceCalls as sender of RouteIntent in mode RoutineSelection.
SdpMcpAdapter uses McpCalls as receiver of RequestRoutine in mode RoutineSelection.
SdpMcpAdapter uses McpCalls as sender of RoutineResponse in mode RoutineSelection.
SdpTool consumes DocumentDeliveryPort.
SdpTool consumes DocumentSnapshotPort.
SdpTool consumes ModelProjectionPort.
SdpTool provides ProjectServices.
SdpTool uses BoardCalls as receiver of ReadBoard in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdpTool uses BoardCalls as sender of BoardSnapshot in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdpTool uses GovernanceCalls as receiver of RouteIntent in mode RoutineSelection.
SdpTool uses GovernanceCalls as sender of RouteDecision in mode RoutineSelection.
SdpTool uses NavigationCalls as receiver of SelectModelView in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdpTool uses NavigationCalls as sender of SelectedDocument in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdpTool uses ProjectionCalls as receiver of ProjectedDocument in mode ModelBrowsing.
SdpTool uses ProjectionCalls as sender of ProjectValidatedModel in mode ModelBrowsing.
SduiCodegen provides UiCodeGeneration.
SduiFrontend provides UiParsing.
SduiNativeHost consumes UiEventsPort.
SduiNativeHost consumes UiGeometryPort.
SduiPresentation consumes UiParsingPort.
SduiPresentation provides UiGeometry.
SduiRuntime consumes ActionExecutionPort.
SduiRuntime provides UiEvents.
SelectModelView has message-kind = request.
SelectModelView upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
SelectedDocument has message-kind = result.
SelectedDocument replies-to SelectModelView.
SelectedDocument upholds CollaborationEnvelope.
